ination for a relaxing camping experience in Northeast Pennsylvania. Situated on 100 beautiful acres in the Pocono Mountains, our campground has scenic views of the mountains and countryside and is a beautiful, well-maintained park that was designed and developed with campers in mind by the Gianelli family in 1980. Come learn what makes us different! For your convenience, you will find a copy of our campground map below so you can familiarize yourself with the layout before you visit! You can view any point in our campground by clicking on a dot on the map below to bring up a 360-degree image. Take in the full beauty of the Chesntu Lake Campground","photo":"https://chestnutlakecampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Chestnut-Lake-Campground-Poconos-Pennsylvania-Family-Camping-Our-Campground.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":8}]},{"name":"Boat Rentals","desc":"Canoes, rowboats, and more! Grab a family member or friend and venture out onto Chestnut Lake in one of our boat rentals and paddle to your heart's","photo":"https://chestnutlakecampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/Canoeing.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":9}]},{"name":"Basketball & Pickleball","desc":"Grab the ball or paddles and get your game on with our on-site basketball and pickleball court! It's always a good time to get a game","photo":"https://chestnutlakecampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Amenities-and-Activities-Template-copy.png","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":10}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"This is the Poconos' best-kept secret! Chestnut Lake Campground in Brodheadsville, PA is a year-round campground that is an escape into peaceful relaxation in the heart of Northern Pennsylvania beauty.","cover":"https://chestnutlakecampground.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Chestnut-Lake-Campground-Poconos-Pennsylvani